<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Serer</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Serer are a people of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/senegambia">Senegambia</a> region of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/west-africa">West Africa</a>, known for their distinct religious traditions and kingdoms such as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-sine">Sine</a> and Saloum. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jolof-empire">Jolof Empire</a> profile mentions the Serer among the neighbouring peoples and states whose interactions shaped the regional balance of power.</p></div>
